  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Power Consumption",
      "id": 11,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read a run",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Set the time range to each phase: **Idle** (no VMs) \u2192 **VMs-up** (Running, no FIO) \u2192 **Workload** (steady-state, skip ramp).\n\n**Cluster total** = Redfish `kepler_platform_watts` (BMC chassis watts). **RAPL (Kepler)** = CPU+DRAM (~42\u201349% of platform) for VM shape. Empty platform series means BMC 401 / Redfish off.\n\nLegend shows **mean / max / min** for the selected range. Use **mean or median**, not max, for consumption."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cluster total (Redfish)",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "thanos"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "watt",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "BMC 401 / no series",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
